        "Evaluate potential team members on:\n- Demonstrated skill\n- Reliability\n- Communication\n- Ability to work independently\n- Response to feedback\n- Professional conduct\n- Ownership of outcomes\n- Availability and compensation expectations\nUse a paid trial project or a clearly scoped test where appropriate. Define roles and decision rights before work begins.\n10.5 Build the team without pretending every skill is equal\nThe source founder's initial pillars included filming, editing, copywriting, and performance marketing, with graphic design still developing. He says the agency used the strengths it was confident in while improving the weaker area.",
