        "20.2 First-client discovery questions\nAsk the prospect:\n1. What are you trying to achieve?\n2. What is currently not working?\n3. What have you already tried?\n4. Who is the target customer?\n5. What does success look like?\n6. What is the timeline?\n7. Who approves the work?\n8. What budget range has been allocated?\n9. What assets or access can you provide?\n10. What would make this engagement unsuccessful?\nListen before proposing a package.\n20.3 Project proposal template\nPROJECT PROPOSAL",
